UID:task-alarm-issue-pantry-window-sensor-2026-09-01@itlegend-co-scheduli
 ng-system
DTSTAMP:20260901T021723Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260901T021723Z
DTSTART:20260901T071500Z
DTEND:20260901T084500Z
SUMMARY:Alarm Issue
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Work
DESCRIPTION:Aron reported that Karen found the pantry window open even th
 ough the office alarm had been armed after Ros last closed the office. Te
 sting found that the sensor reports a slightly open window as closed but 
 detects it when opened wider. Rewire and reposition the sensor below the 
